1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:09,680
Speaking, task one. Topic 20: Travel and holidays. Ten questions. Listen to the question and answer out loud.

2
00:00:10,533 --> 00:00:11,863
Do you like travelling?

3
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:21,024
Yes, I like travelling — I discover new places.

4
00:00:21,867 --> 00:00:23,536
How do you most like to travel?

5
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:32,829
I most like travelling by car, because I can stop wherever I want.

6
00:00:33,667 --> 00:00:35,336
Where do you go on holiday?

7
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,401
We go to the seaside or to the mountains on holiday.

8
00:00:44,267 --> 00:00:46,250
How many days does your holiday last?

9
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:54,641
Our holiday usually lasts ten days.

10
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:57,117
What do you take on a trip?

11
00:01:02,767 --> 00:01:06,813
I take my passport, money, phone and clothes.

12
00:01:07,667 --> 00:01:09,702
Where did you go on your last holiday?

13
00:01:15,367 --> 00:01:18,003
On my last holiday I was at the seaside in Italy.

14
00:01:18,867 --> 00:01:20,353
What did you do there?

15
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:29,759
I swam, ate pizza and looked around the town.

16
00:01:30,600 --> 00:01:32,635
What was your worst trip?

17
00:01:38,300 --> 00:01:41,641
The worst trip was when our car broke down on the motorway.

18
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:44,222
Where will you go next summer?

19
00:01:49,867 --> 00:01:52,451
Next summer we'll go to Croatia for two weeks.

20
00:01:53,300 --> 00:01:55,675
Which country would you like to visit and why?

21
00:02:01,333 --> 00:02:04,962
I'd like to visit Japan because it has an interesting culture.

22
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:15,541
Great! Practise topic 20 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website — the link is in the video description. And subscribe to the channel — there's a new video every day.
